; dsv4-decode-token-hook-band.fk — a Form recipe sits between argmax and the
; next embedding. Verdict 1023 when the hook is in the pipeline.
;
;   1     attestant (no offer) emits (0 1)
;   2     a nothing-ack keeps the attestant stream
;   4     a kernel recipe replacing 0 with 2 yields (2 2) — next embed is of 2
;   8     the first-step choice is token 2 for reason recipe-more-vital
;   16    logits after 2 argmax to 2; logits after 0 argmax to 1
;   32    a late recipe keeps the attestant stream
;   64    late alternative-state is timeout-nothing
;   128   the kernel witness carries JIT MSL
;   256   argmax of the first step is still 0 — the default was sampled
;   512   the named hook gap has been attempted and observed (attention -> claim)
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk form-stdlib/dsv4-token-recipe-swap.fk form-stdlib/dsv4-decode-token-hook.fk

(do (ddth-check))
